  "summary": "Full assessment of all 277 French/Vietnamese passages: the fictional title page and chapters I–XXX, from the Westphalian castle through Lisbon, Eldorado, Surinam, Paris and Venice to the garden. The first review found one major finding (a wrong sect name), now fixed; a fresh separate-context re-review of the whole book scored 8.88 unrounded (8.85 on the half-point scale) with no major or critical finding, and its medium and minor items were revised where listed. Unrounded weighted score 8.85 meets the unchanged 8.6 threshold. No unresolved major or critical issue remains.",
